  "sort_order": "133236",
  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Heavy Duty Range Belt features a sturdy two-layer composition that can handle mounted holsters, mag pouches, and more.&nbsp; The range belt features two layers of webbing until the end of the loop section, and the bottom layer acts as a built-in inner duty belt. The end of the loop section is one layer for folding around the buckle. The belt is composed of highly durable materials and includes a matte black zinc alloy buckle closure for easy putting on and taking off. This shooting belt is perfect for gun enthusiasts, tactical professionals, MilSim players, and more. The belt available in four sizes: Small fits waists up to 32 inches, Medium fits waists up to 35 inches, Large fits waists up to 39 inches, X-Large fits waists up to 43 inches.</p>",
